 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Put the <b>olive oil</b> and <b>garlic</b> in a small cold pan and warm it over low heat until the garlic is pale gold, 4–5 minutes. Darker garlic turns bitter.</li><li>Off the heat, add the <b>chilli flakes</b> and <b>salt</b>. Fold the oil and garlic through the rice before shaping, about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 tsp</span> per onigiri.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "low",
    "label_html": "<span>low</span>",
    "off": false
   },
